## Frontend preview

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm exec next dev -p 3001
```

Preview at `http://localhost:3001`. Next may also advertise a Network URL on
`127.0.2.2`; that origin is allowed in `next.config.ts`, but localhost is the
reliable demo URL.

This command starts the frontend only. `pnpm dev` runs the configured development
launcher, which may also require the source VPK backend.
After a verified lockfile is committed, use `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`
for reproducible installs of the published repository.

