## Asset inventory

The initial extraction preserves all public assets, including dynamic lookups.
After installation, review an optional pruning plan:

```sh
node scripts/audit-public-assets.mjs --plan . output/asset-prune-plan.json
# Review candidates and runtime directories before deleting anything.
node scripts/audit-public-assets.mjs --apply output/asset-prune-plan.json
```

Rebuild and verify the affected views after pruning. Referenced decorative artwork
requires an explicit design change before removal. Removing current files does
not remove their bytes from Git history.
